37303>>>    Procedure OnLoad
37306>>>        String sPrevStateHash sView
37306>>>        
37306>>>        Forward Send OnLoad
37308>>>        
37308>>>        //  Store the current state so we can go back to that later (only if it points to a different view)
37308>>>        Get StateHash of ghoWebApp to sPrevStateHash
37309>>>        Send ParseViewStateHash sPrevStateHash (&sView)
37310>>>        If (Lowercase(sView) <> Lowercase(psStateViewName(Self))) Begin
37312>>>            WebSet psPrevStateHash to sPrevStateHash
37313>>>        End
37313>>>>
37313>>>        
37313>>>    End_Procedure
